{"articleNo":"243442","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=243442&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 엡스코 온라인 교육 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.10.08","hit":"9349","attachments":[{"name":"20200914 [NEW] EBSCO Mobile 앱(app)으로 보다 스마트하게 학술정보 활용하기 (1).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=243442&attachNo=93042"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">코로나19 확산에 따라 집합교육을 진행하기 어려운 상황으로 아래와 같이 온라인교육을 개설하였습니다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;1. 일시 : 2020. 10. 14.(수) ~ 10. 16.(금)</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp;신청 : 아래 등록링크를 통해 교육을 신청 후, 신청시 입력한 본인 이메일을 통해 개별접속 URL 부여, 당일 접속 가능</p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" id=\"SE-4f34146a-27a5-48c7-ae08-b73b0598af4e\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-d09cf9b0-20e3-449c-aec4-d0ba4d5e47a7\" style=\"color: rgb(123, 180, 35);\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PC 참여시</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-866d3d35-b1fb-4a40-8594-58b02d9ec493\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 참여하고 싶은 온라인 교육을 미리 등록하기 위해</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-2d82c0a7-ca37-4885-a6ad-0fdbf72c2367\" style=\"color: rgb(152, 211, 108);\"><strong>등록 링크</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-3c445c87-e17c-4ddc-bc54-680e3171bd4c\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;클릭</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-ded84a6b-3670-40f6-8ace-25d01677a49b\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 참석자 이름과 이메일 등을 입력 후 등록</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-9de4d51d-0b60-4b2c-9d63-3c944f710d70\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 등록 시 입력한 이메일을 통해</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-821c0e46-9fb0-4772-84aa-9a56ad7b8957\" style=\"color: rgb(152, 211, 108);\"><strong>등록 완료 이메일 확인</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-3a979014-9f59-4c12-a624-985ad204fec4\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;후 참여 방법 확인</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-5f06efaf-2b23-443b-b642-7fb0831020f4\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 참여 방법 내 링크 클릭 후 지금참여 클릭 (실시간 온라인 교육 프로그램 자동 설치)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-6b95b925-3626-4fc9-9323-0f6c22cf9fba\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 접속 완료 (접속 후</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-168f0112-f7b9-4e52-b641-984686ae0178\" style=\"color: rgb(152, 211, 108);\"><strong>최초 오디오 설정 필수</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-3dbb6512-ac4a-4799-892d-9310c338f66b\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" id=\"SE-4960b852-172e-4d3b-ad1d-131285d40b14\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-82140524-3272-4e6a-a81f-0e04719a1341\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 146, 230);\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;스마트폰 참여시</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-e91d4f83-71b7-4400-a677-c64219db41fd\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 참여하고 싶은 온라인 교육을 미리 등록하기 위해</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-39e2dd65-d15c-44da-b643-139f3ae912fb\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>등록 링크</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-a29623a0-4e4b-4bdb-a269-1a4f69b9d4c5\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;클릭 후&nbsp;</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-21da0aa7-7148-4a2d-ad9b-d818687399e2\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>세션 번호 확인</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-880f6692-05f2-4981-a259-a90e1e778d47\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;(9자리)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-c6ac4eeb-6d45-4197-adc1-157e5053a36c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- WebEx</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-6acd63d1-dd34-4aaf-b5cd-c22d873f9655\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>앱(app) 다운로드</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-12d6f065-1691-4d7f-8f87-ee87ca47c124\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;(앱스토어 또는 Google Play) 후 온라인 교육 시간에 맞춰</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-71a7e247-8a0c-4ef3-99b2-7a03d578a1ba\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>앱(app) 접속</strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-adbf653e-7e23-49ef-a2e6-05334fbe9ee0\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- '미팅에 참여' 클릭 후&nbsp;</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-f3a36ae5-6e51-4aa1-8067-1e60b648a6fb\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>세션 번호 (9자리), 참석자 이름, 이메일 입력</strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-bd3a6f41-f4f0-49e2-b404-43642a7f76cc\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 접속 완료 (접속 후&nbsp;</span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-129bbae2-c3df-4043-8c1a-57773f1a401f\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 242);\"><strong>최초 오디오 설정 필수</strong></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumsquare se-fs-fs16 se-style-unset\" id=\"SE-423afc48-77c4-4606-a6f7-c1188c7753d5\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">3. 주의사항: 교육은 실시간으로 진행됨으로 원활한 교육을 위해 교육진행 최소 10분 정도 전에 접속 URL을 통해 접속하여 오디오(스피커)세팅필요</span></span></p><div c